WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:06.798 position:63%
<i>When I first got off the bus years ago, 
I had the strangest feeling...</i>

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.342
<i>that I’d come home.</i>

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.983
Did anyone ever tell you

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.610
how I came to live at Barbary Lane
in the first place?

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:31.364
<i>I read an ad,
and you know what it said?</i>

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.576 position:56%
"You’ll know if it's right for you."

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:41.207
There is no better reward
in a person's life...

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:47.046
<i>than to see a building turned
from walls of brick...</i>

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:52.761
<i>to a nest of warm stories...</i>

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.433
<i>and warm hearts.</i>

